<title>UK: Simco sets 2.0 bln ffr convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Simco sets 2.0 bln ffr convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Societe Generale and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Simco</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY  **01.JAN.06</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  518 FFR   PAY DATE    09.JUL.97</p>
<p>			    LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>NOTES  ** CALL 01.JAN.03 AT ACCRETED VALUE SUBJECT TO 130 PCT RULE</p>
<p> GOV LW     PARIS     DENOMS     518 FFR SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA/JP</p>
<p> NOTES	CONVERTIBLE INTO SHARES OF SIMCO. PREMIUM 9.28 PCT</p>
<p>		EX DIVIDEND, SIMCO WILL PAY 20.8 FFR DIVIDEND ON</p>
<p>		04.JUL.YIELD TO MATURITY 5.0 PCT, REDEMPTION 611 FFR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
